ORB_Recorder — public domain dedication
=======================================

Written by Alex Maximilius ("Alex Maz") — https://github.com/AlexMaximilius
Dedicated to the public domain by its copyright holder, 2026.

Two lines rather than one on purpose. A dedication works by a copyright
holder giving up rights, so it needs someone able to hold them. Authorship
and the capacity to sign rights away are different questions; this states
both rather than collapsing them and leaving the dedication on uncertain
ground.

